<h1>ANTROPOSENTRIK TILSHUNOSLIK FANI</h1>
<h2>Oraliq va Yakuniy Nazorat Savollari</h2>
<div class="section-line"></div>
<h2>I. TEST SAVOLLARI (100 ta)</h2>
<p><i>To'g'ri javob — qalin shrift bilan belgilangan</i></p>


<p class="question">1. Antroposentrik tilshunoslik nimani o'rganadi?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Tilning grammatik tuzilishini</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Til va inson munosabatlarini</p>
<p class="answer">C) Tilning fonetik tizimini</p>
<p class="answer">D) Faqat leksik birliklarni</p>

<p class="question">2. Antroposentrik paradigma tilshunoslikda qachon shakllana boshlagan?</p>
<p class="answer">A) XVIII asr</p>
<p class="answer">B) XIX asr oxiri</p>
<p class="answer correct">C) XX asr oxiri — XXI asr boshi</p>
<p class="answer">D) XVII asr</p>

<p class="question">3. "Antroposentrizm" atamasi qaysi tildan olingan?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Lotincha</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Yunon tilidan</p>
<p class="answer">C) Arab tilidan</p>
<p class="answer">D) Fransuz tilidan</p>

<p class="question">4. Antroposentrik yondashuvning asosiy g'oyasi nima?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Til — mustaqil tizim</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Inson — til tadqiqotining markazi</p>
<p class="answer">C) Grammatika — tilning asosi</p>
<p class="answer">D) Til — faqat kommunikatsiya vositasi</p>

<p class="question">5. Quyidagilardan qaysi biri antroposentrik tilshunoslikning yo'nalishi hisoblanadi?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Komparativistika</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Kognitiv tilshunoslik</p>
<p class="answer">C) Strukturalizm</p>
<p class="answer">D) Deskriptivizm</p>


<p class="question">6. Tilshunoslikda "til tasviri" (yazykovaya kartina mira) tushunchasi kimga tegishli?</p>
<p class="answer">A) F. de Sossyur</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) V. fon Gumboldt</p>
<p class="answer">C) N. Xomskiy</p>
<p class="answer">D) L. Blumfild</p>

<p class="question">7. Lingvokulturologiya nimani o'rganadi?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Til tuzilishini</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Til va madaniyat munosabatini</p>
<p class="answer">C) Nutq tovushlarini</p>
<p class="answer">D) So'z yasalishini</p>

<p class="question">8. Konsept nima?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Grammatik kategoriya</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Madaniy ma'lumotga ega bo'lgan mental birlik</p>
<p class="answer">C) Fonetik birlik</p>
<p class="answer">D) Sintaktik birlik</p>

<p class="question">9. Kognitiv tilshunoslikning asoschilaridan biri kim?</p>
<p class="answer">A) F. de Sossyur</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) J. Leykoff</p>
<p class="answer">C) A. Shleyxer</p>
<p class="answer">D) I.A. Boduen de Kurtene</p>

<p class="question">10. Til va tafakkur munosabati qaysi fanning tadqiqot ob'yekti?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Fonetika</p>
<p class="answer">B) Leksikologiya</p>
<p class="answer correct">C) Psixolingvistika</p>
<p class="answer">D) Morfologiya</p>

<p class="question">11. "Sapir-Uorf gipotezasi" nimaga asoslangan?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Til universallilariga</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Til tafakkurni belgilaydi</p>
<p class="answer">C) Grammatik strukturaga</p>
<p class="answer">D) Fonologik tizimga</p>

<p class="question">12. Lingvopragmatika nimani o'rganadi?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Til tarixi</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Tilning muloqotdagi ishlatilishini</p>
<p class="answer">C) Dialektlarni</p>
<p class="answer">D) Yozuv tarixini</p>


<p class="question">13. Diskurs nima?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Alohida gap</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Muloqot jarayonidagi bog'langan nutq</p>
<p class="answer">C) Lug'aviy birlik</p>
<p class="answer">D) Grammatik qoida</p>

<p class="question">14. Metafora kognitiv tilshunoslikda qanday talqin etiladi?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Badiiy vosita sifatida</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Tafakkur mexanizmi sifatida</p>
<p class="answer">C) Grammatik hodisa sifatida</p>
<p class="answer">D) Fonetik hodisa sifatida</p>

<p class="question">15. Freym nazariyasi kim tomonidan ishlab chiqilgan?</p>
<p class="answer">A) N. Xomskiy</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) M. Minskiy</p>
<p class="answer">C) F. de Sossyur</p>
<p class="answer">D) L. Vitgenshteyn</p>

<p class="question">16. Til shaxsiyati (yazykovaya lichnost') tushunchasini kim ilgari surgan?</p>
<p class="answer">A) V. Vinogradov</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Yu.N. Karaulov</p>
<p class="answer">C) A.A. Potebnya</p>
<p class="answer">D) L.V. Sherba</p>

<p class="question">17. Quyidagilardan qaysi biri kognitiv tilshunoslik kategoriyasi?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Ega</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Prototip</p>
<p class="answer">C) Kesim</p>
<p class="answer">D) Aniqlovchi</p>

<p class="question">18. Etnolingvistika nimani tadqiq qiladi?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Tilning fonetik jihatini</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Til va xalq madaniyati aloqasini</p>
<p class="answer">C) Grammatik qoidalarni</p>
<p class="answer">D) Nutq texnologiyalarini</p>

<p class="question">19. Til ongining asosiy birligi nima?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Gap</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Konsept</p>
<p class="answer">C) Morfema</p>
<p class="answer">D) Fonema</p>

<p class="question">20. Genderlingvistika nimani o'rganadi?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Tilning tarixiy rivojlanishini</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Til va jins (gender) munosabatini</p>
<p class="answer">C) Dialektlarni</p>
<p class="answer">D) Terminologiyani</p>


<p class="question">21. Pragmatika atamasini birinchi kim ishlatgan?</p>
<p class="answer">A) F. de Sossyur</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Ch. Morris</p>
<p class="answer">C) N. Xomskiy</p>
<p class="answer">D) R. Yakobson</p>

<p class="question">22. Kommunikativ lingvistikaning asosiy ob'yekti nima?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Til tizimi</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Muloqot jarayoni</p>
<p class="answer">C) Grammatik qoidalar</p>
<p class="answer">D) Fonetik o'zgarishlar</p>

<p class="question">23. "Til tasviri" (yazykovaya kartina mira) nima?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Grammatik tizim</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Inson ongida til vositasida aks etgan dunyo modeli</p>
<p class="answer">C) Lug'at tarkibi</p>
<p class="answer">D) Fonetik tizim</p>

<p class="question">24. Quyidagilardan qaysi biri antroposentrik tilshunoslik prinsipi emas?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Insonmarkazlilik</p>
<p class="answer">B) Ekspansionizm</p>
<p class="answer correct">C) Reduktsionizm</p>
<p class="answer">D) Funksionalizm</p>

<p class="question">25. Neologizmlarning paydo bo'lishi qaysi omil bilan bog'liq?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Faqat grammatik qoidalar</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Jamiyat va inson tafakkuri rivojlanishi</p>
<p class="answer">C) Fonetik o'zgarishlar</p>
<p class="answer">D) Morfologik jarayon</p>

<p class="question">26. Lingvokognitologiya nimani o'rganadi?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Tilning tarixini</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Til va bilish jarayonlari aloqasini</p>
<p class="answer">C) Dialektlarni</p>
<p class="answer">D) Yozuv tarixini</p>

<p class="question">27. Valentlik nazariyasi kim bilan bog'liq?</p>
<p class="answer">A) N. Xomskiy</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) L. Ten'yer</p>
<p class="answer">C) F. de Sossyur</p>
<p class="answer">D) V. fon Gumboldt</p>

<p class="question">28. Antropomorfizm tilshunoslikda nimani anglatadi?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Til tizimi tahlili</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Inson xususiyatlarini boshqa narsalarga ko'chirish</p>
<p class="answer">C) Grammatik tahlil</p>
<p class="answer">D) Fonetik jarayon</p>


<p class="question">29. Emotiv lingvistika nimani o'rganadi?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Tilning tuzilishini</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Tildagi emotsional (hissiy) ifodalanishni</p>
<p class="answer">C) Tilning tarixini</p>
<p class="answer">D) Grammatik kategoriyalarni</p>

<p class="question">30. Til va madaniyat munosabatini birinchi bo'lib qaysi olim tadqiq qilgan?</p>
<p class="answer">A) F. de Sossyur</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) V. fon Gumboldt</p>
<p class="answer">C) N. Xomskiy</p>
<p class="answer">D) L. Blumfild</p>

<p class="question">31. Quyidagilardan qaysi biri kognitiv metafora?</p>
<p class="answer">A) "Gul yuzli"</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) "Vaqt — pul"</p>
<p class="answer">C) "Oy chiqdi"</p>
<p class="answer">D) "Kitob o'qidim"</p>

<p class="question">32. Tilshunoslikda "inson omili" (chelovecheskiy faktor) nimani bildiradi?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Grammatik qoidalarni</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Inson — tilning yaratuvchisi va foydalanuvchisi</p>
<p class="answer">C) Fonetik tizimni</p>
<p class="answer">D) Leksik birliklarni</p>

<p class="question">33. Sotsiolingvistika nimani tadqiq qiladi?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Tilning ichki tuzilishini</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Til va jamiyat munosabatini</p>
<p class="answer">C) Fonetik hodisalarni</p>
<p class="answer">D) Morfologik jarayonlarni</p>

<p class="question">34. Kontseptosfera nima?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Grammatik kategoriyalar tizimi</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Millat yoki shaxs ongidagi konseptlar yig'indisi</p>
<p class="answer">C) Leksik birliklar tizimi</p>
<p class="answer">D) Sintaktik konstruktsiyalar</p>

<p class="question">35. Til va identifikatsiya (o'zlikni anglash) munosabati qaysi fan doirasida o'rganiladi?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Morfologiya</p>
<p class="answer">B) Fonetika</p>
<p class="answer correct">C) Sotsiolingvistika</p>
<p class="answer">D) Sintaksis</p>

<p class="question">36. "Nutq aktlari nazariyasi" kim tomonidan yaratilgan?</p>
<p class="answer">A) N. Xomskiy</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) J. Ostin</p>
<p class="answer">C) F. de Sossyur</p>
<p class="answer">D) V. fon Gumboldt</p>


<p class="question">37. Illokutiv akt nima?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Gapning grammatik tuzilishi</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) So'zlovchining kommunikativ niyati (maqsadi)</p>
<p class="answer">C) Fonetik jihat</p>
<p class="answer">D) Leksik ma'no</p>

<p class="question">38. Lokutiv akt nima?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Nutqning maqsadi</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Gapni aytish (talaffuz qilish) jarayoni</p>
<p class="answer">C) Tinglovchiga ta'sir</p>
<p class="answer">D) Grammatik tahlil</p>

<p class="question">39. Perlokutiv akt nima?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Gapni aytish</p>
<p class="answer">B) Grammatik tuzilish</p>
<p class="answer correct">C) Nutqning tinglovchiga ta'siri</p>
<p class="answer">D) Fonetik jihat</p>

<p class="question">40. Antroposentrik paradigmada tilning qaysi funksiyasi muhim?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Faqat kommunikativ</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Kommunikativ, kognitiv va kumulyativ funksiyalari</p>
<p class="answer">C) Faqat kognitiv</p>
<p class="answer">D) Faqat estetik</p>

<p class="question">41. Kumulyativ funksiya nimani anglatadi?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Muloqot vositasi</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Tilning bilim va tajribani to'plash funksiyasi</p>
<p class="answer">C) Tafakkur vositasi</p>
<p class="answer">D) Estetik funksiya</p>

<p class="question">42. Lingvokulturologiyaning asosiy birligi nima?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Fonema</p>
<p class="answer">B) Morfema</p>
<p class="answer correct">C) Lingvokulturema</p>
<p class="answer">D) Sintaksema</p>

<p class="question">43. "Milliy til tasviri" tushunchasi qaysi olim ishlarida rivojlantirilgan?</p>
<p class="answer">A) N. Xomskiy</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Anna Vejbitskaya</p>
<p class="answer">C) L. Blumfild</p>
<p class="answer">D) R. Yakobson</p>

<p class="question">44. Presuppozitsiya nima?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Gapning grammatik tuzilishi</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Nutqiy holatning oldindan taxmin qilingan bilimi</p>
<p class="answer">C) Fonetik jarayon</p>
<p class="answer">D) Leksik ma'no</p>


<p class="question">45. Implikatura tushunchasi kim tomonidan kiritilgan?</p>
<p class="answer">A) J. Ostin</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) G.P. Grays</p>
<p class="answer">C) N. Xomskiy</p>
<p class="answer">D) F. de Sossyur</p>

<p class="question">46. Konnotatsiya nima?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Asosiy leksik ma'no</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) So'zning qo'shimcha emotsional-baholovchi ma'nosi</p>
<p class="answer">C) Grammatik ma'no</p>
<p class="answer">D) Fonetik xususiyat</p>

<p class="question">47. Antroposentrik tilshunoslikda "dunyo modeli" (model' mira) nimani bildiradi?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Grammatik tizim</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Inson ongida shakllangan dunyoni tushunish tizimi</p>
<p class="answer">C) Fonetik tizim</p>
<p class="answer">D) Yozuv tizimi</p>

<p class="question">48. Quyidagilardan qaysi biri tilshunoslikning antroposentrik paradigmasiga tegishli emas?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Kognitiv lingvistika</p>
<p class="answer">B) Pragmalingvistika</p>
<p class="answer correct">C) Komparativ tilshunoslik</p>
<p class="answer">D) Lingvokulturologiya</p>

<p class="question">49. Emotsional konseptlar qaysi fanda o'rganiladi?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Fonetikada</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Emotiv lingvistikada</p>
<p class="answer">C) Morfologiyada</p>
<p class="answer">D) Sintaksisda</p>

<p class="question">50. Jaques Derridaning tilshunoslikka qo'shgan hissasi nima?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Strukturalizm</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Dekonstruktsiya nazariyasi</p>
<p class="answer">C) Generativ grammatika</p>
<p class="answer">D) Komparativistika</p>

<p class="question">51. Kategoriyalash (kategorizatsiya) nima?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Grammatik tahlil usuli</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Inson ongida olamni tasniflash jarayoni</p>
<p class="answer">C) Fonetik o'zgarish</p>
<p class="answer">D) Leksik tahlil</p>

<p class="question">52. Prototip nazariyasi kim tomonidan ishlab chiqilgan?</p>
<p class="answer">A) N. Xomskiy</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) E. Rosh</p>
<p class="answer">C) F. de Sossyur</p>
<p class="answer">D) L. Blumfild</p>


<p class="question">53. Tilshunoslikda "blending" (kontseptual integratsiya) nazariyasi kimga tegishli?</p>
<p class="answer">A) J. Leykoff</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) J. Fokonye va M. Tyorner</p>
<p class="answer">C) F. de Sossyur</p>
<p class="answer">D) N. Xomskiy</p>

<p class="question">54. Idiomalar antroposentrik tilshunoslikda qanday talqin etiladi?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Grammatik hodisa</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Milliy madaniyat va tafakkurning akslanishi</p>
<p class="answer">C) Fonetik hodisa</p>
<p class="answer">D) Stilistik vosita</p>

<p class="question">55. "Konseptual metafora" atamasi qaysi olim ishida asosiy hisoblanadi?</p>
<p class="answer">A) F. de Sossyur</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) J. Leykoff va M. Jonson</p>
<p class="answer">C) N. Xomskiy</p>
<p class="answer">D) R. Yakobson</p>

<p class="question">56. Qadriyatlar (tsennosti) tilda qanday ifodalanadi?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Faqat grammatik vositalar orqali</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Leksik, frazeologik va grammatik vositalar orqali</p>
<p class="answer">C) Faqat fonetik vositalar orqali</p>
<p class="answer">D) Faqat sintaktik vositalar orqali</p>

<p class="question">57. Til va ong munosabati qaysi fan doirasida o'rganiladi?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Fonetika</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Kognitiv tilshunoslik</p>
<p class="answer">C) Dialektologiya</p>
<p class="answer">D) Paleografiya</p>

<p class="question">58. Tilning aksiologik funksiyasi nima?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Muloqot</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Baholash funksiyasi</p>
<p class="answer">C) Bilim to'plash</p>
<p class="answer">D) Estetik funksiya</p>

<p class="question">59. "Olamning ilmiy tasviri" va "olamning sodda (naiv) tasviri" farqi nimada?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Grammatik tuzilishda</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Ilmiy tasvir — fan asosida, sodda tasvir — kundalik tajriba asosida</p>
<p class="answer">C) Fonetik jihatda</p>
<p class="answer">D) Leksik jihatda</p>

<p class="question">60. Quyidagilardan qaysi biri antroposentrik tilshunoslikning prinsipiga kiradi?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Reduktsionizm</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Ekspansionizm</p>
<p class="answer">C) Izolyatsionizm</p>
<p class="answer">D) Determinizm</p>


<p class="question">61. "Ekspansionizm" prinsipi nimani anglatadi?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Tilni tor doirada o'rganish</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Tilshunoslikning boshqa fanlar bilan integratsiyalashuvi</p>
<p class="answer">C) Grammatikani rad etish</p>
<p class="answer">D) Fonetikani ustun qo'yish</p>

<p class="question">62. Antroponimika nimani o'rganadi?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Hayvon nomlarini</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Shaxs (inson) nomlarini</p>
<p class="answer">C) Joy nomlarini</p>
<p class="answer">D) Narsa nomlarini</p>

<p class="question">63. Somatik frazeologizmlar nimaga asoslangan?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Hayvon nomlariga</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Inson tana a'zolari nomlariga</p>
<p class="answer">C) O'simlik nomlariga</p>
<p class="answer">D) Rang nomlariga</p>

<p class="question">64. "Suggestiv lingvistika" nimani o'rganadi?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Grammatik tuzilishni</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Tilning ta'sir kuchi va ruhiy ta'sirini</p>
<p class="answer">C) Fonetik hodisalarni</p>
<p class="answer">D) Leksik birliklarni</p>

<p class="question">65. Tilshunoslikda "modal'nost'" (modallik) nima?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Fonetik kategoriya</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) So'zlovchining voqelikka munosabati</p>
<p class="answer">C) Leksik birlik</p>
<p class="answer">D) Sintaktik birlik</p>

<p class="question">66. Evidentsiallik (evidensialnost') nima?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Grammatik vaqt</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Axborot manbaiga ko'rsatish (ishonchlilik darajasi)</p>
<p class="answer">C) So'z yasalish</p>
<p class="answer">D) Fonetik o'zgarish</p>

<p class="question">67. Lingvistik relativizm nima?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Tilning universalligi</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Har bir til o'z tafakkur tizimini shakllantiradi</p>
<p class="answer">C) Barcha tillar bir xil</p>
<p class="answer">D) Grammatikaning ustuvorligi</p>

<p class="question">68. "Olamning lisoniy manzarasi" tushunchasi o'zbek tilshunosligida kim tomonidan ishlab chiqilgan?</p>
<p class="answer">A) A. G'ulomov</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Sh. Safarov</p>
<p class="answer">C) A. Hojiyev</p>
<p class="answer">D) N. Mahmudov</p>


<p class="question">69. Quyidagilardan qaysi biri konseptning tarkibiy qismiga kiradi?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Fonema va morfema</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Tushuncha yadrosi, obraz va baholash</p>
<p class="answer">C) Ega va kesim</p>
<p class="answer">D) Aniqlovchi va to'ldiruvchi</p>

<p class="question">70. "Mental leksikon" nima?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Lug'at kitobi</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Inson ongidagi leksik birliklar tizimi</p>
<p class="answer">C) Grammatik qoidalar to'plami</p>
<p class="answer">D) Fonetik tizim</p>

<p class="question">71. Tilshunoslikda "skript" (ssenariy) nima?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Badiiy asar</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Voqea-hodisalarning ketma-ket tartibi haqidagi bilim tuzilmasi</p>
<p class="answer">C) Grammatik qoida</p>
<p class="answer">D) Fonetik jarayon</p>

<p class="question">72. Sxema (freym) va skript orasidagi farq nimada?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Farq yo'q</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Freym — statik bilim, skript — dinamik (ketma-ket) bilim</p>
<p class="answer">C) Faqat hajmda</p>
<p class="answer">D) Faqat tilda</p>

<p class="question">73. "Til shaxsiyati"ning necha darajasi bor (Karaulov bo'yicha)?</p>
<p class="answer">A) 2 ta</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) 3 ta</p>
<p class="answer">C) 4 ta</p>
<p class="answer">D) 5 ta</p>

<p class="question">74. Karaulovning "til shaxsiyati" modelidagi birinchi daraja qaysi?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Kognitiv</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Verbal-semantik (lingvistik)</p>
<p class="answer">C) Pragmatik (motivatsion)</p>
<p class="answer">D) Emotsional</p>

<p class="question">75. Til shaxsiyatining ikkinchi darajasi qaysi?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Verbal-semantik</p>
<p class="answer">B) Pragmatik</p>
<p class="answer correct">C) Lingvokognitiv (tezaurus)</p>
<p class="answer">D) Emotsional</p>

<p class="question">76. Til shaxsiyatining uchinchi darajasi qaysi?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Verbal-semantik</p>
<p class="answer">B) Lingvokognitiv</p>
<p class="answer correct">C) Pragmatik (motivatsion)</p>
<p class="answer">D) Fonetik</p>


<p class="question">77. Quyidagi qaysi atama antroposentrik tilshunoslikka tegishli emas?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Konsept</p>
<p class="answer">B) Lingvokulturema</p>
<p class="answer correct">C) Fonema</p>
<p class="answer">D) Freym</p>

<p class="question">78. Inson emotsiyalari tilda qanday vositalar bilan ifodalanadi?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Faqat undovlar orqali</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Leksik, grammatik, prosodik va paratil vositalari orqali</p>
<p class="answer">C) Faqat grammatik vositalar</p>
<p class="answer">D) Faqat fonetik vositalar</p>

<p class="question">79. "Tilning ichki shakli" (vnutrennyaya forma yazyka) g'oyasi kimga tegishli?</p>
<p class="answer">A) F. de Sossyur</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) V. fon Gumboldt</p>
<p class="answer">C) N. Xomskiy</p>
<p class="answer">D) L. Blumfild</p>

<p class="question">80. Quyidagilardan qaysi biri tilshunoslikdagi paradigmalarning to'g'ri ketma-ketligi?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Antroposentrik → Struktural → Qiyosiy-tarixiy</p>
<p class="answer">B) Struktural → Qiyosiy-tarixiy → Antroposentrik</p>
<p class="answer correct">C) Qiyosiy-tarixiy → Struktural → Antroposentrik</p>
<p class="answer">D) Antroposentrik → Qiyosiy-tarixiy → Struktural</p>

<p class="question">81. Lingvopersonologiya nimani o'rganadi?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Tilning tarixini</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Til shaxsiyatini (yazykovuyu lichnost')</p>
<p class="answer">C) Grammatik kategoriyalarni</p>
<p class="answer">D) Fonetik hodisalarni</p>

<p class="question">82. "Vaqt" konsepti qaysi tilshunoslik yo'nalishida keng o'rganiladi?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Fonetika</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Lingvokulturologiya va kognitiv tilshunoslik</p>
<p class="answer">C) Morfologiya</p>
<p class="answer">D) Dialektologiya</p>

<p class="question">83. Kommunikativ muvaffaqiyatsizlik (kommunikativnaya neudacha) nima?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Grammatik xato</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Muloqotda maqsadga erishilmasligi</p>
<p class="answer">C) Fonetik buzilish</p>
<p class="answer">D) Leksik xato</p>

<p class="question">84. Quyidagilardan qaysi biri muloqot strategiyalariga kiradi?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Fonetik tahlil</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Kooperatsiya, manipulyatsiya, konfrontatsiya</p>
<p class="answer">C) Grammatik tahlil</p>
<p class="answer">D) Leksik tahlil</p>


<p class="question">85. Graysning kooperatsiya prinsipi nechta maksimadan iborat?</p>
<p class="answer">A) 3 ta</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) 4 ta</p>
<p class="answer">C) 5 ta</p>
<p class="answer">D) 6 ta</p>

<p class="question">86. Grays maksimalari qaysilar?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Rost, nutq, tarix, madaniyat</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Miqdor, sifat, munosabat, uslub</p>
<p class="answer">C) Fonema, morfema, leksema, gap</p>
<p class="answer">D) Ega, kesim, to'ldiruvchi, hol</p>

<p class="question">87. Miqdor maksimasi nimani talab qiladi?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Hamma narsani aytish</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Kerakli miqdorda axborot berish (ortiqcha emas, kam emas)</p>
<p class="answer">C) Chiroyli gapirish</p>
<p class="answer">D) Tez gapirish</p>

<p class="question">88. Sifat maksimasi nimani talab qiladi?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Ortiqcha gapirmaslik</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Haqiqatga mos axborot berish</p>
<p class="answer">C) Qisqa gapirish</p>
<p class="answer">D) Tez gapirish</p>

<p class="question">89. Munosabat (relevantlik) maksimasi nimani anglatadi?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Chiroyli gapirish</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Mavzuga oid (tegishli) gapirish</p>
<p class="answer">C) Ko'p gapirish</p>
<p class="answer">D) Sekin gapirish</p>

<p class="question">90. Uslub maksimasi nimani talab qiladi?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Ko'p gapirish</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Aniq, tushunarli, tartibli ifodalash</p>
<p class="answer">C) Tez gapirish</p>
<p class="answer">D) Qisqa gapirish</p>

<p class="question">91. Tilshunoslikda "egosentrizm" nima?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Grammatik kategoriya</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Nutqda "men" markaziyligining aks etishi</p>
<p class="answer">C) Fonetik hodisa</p>
<p class="answer">D) Leksik birlik</p>

<p class="question">92. Deyksis (ko'rsatish) nima?</p>
<p class="answer">A) So'z yasalish</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Nutq vaziyatiga murojaat qiluvchi til vositalari (men, bu, shu yerda, hozir)</p>
<p class="answer">C) Grammatik kategoriya</p>
<p class="answer">D) Fonetik hodisa</p>


<p class="question">93. Antroposentrik tilshunoslikda "sub'ekt" kimni anglatadi?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Grammatik ega</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) So'zlovchi shaxs — nutq ishtirokchisi</p>
<p class="answer">C) Fe'lning to'ldiruvchisi</p>
<p class="answer">D) Fonetik birlik</p>

<p class="question">94. Intertekstuallik nima?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Grammatik tahlil</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Matnlar orasidagi aloqa va munosabat</p>
<p class="answer">C) Fonetik jarayon</p>
<p class="answer">D) Leksik tahlil</p>

<p class="question">95. Precedent matn nima?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Yangi yaratilgan matn</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Jamiyatda keng tanilgan, ko'p murojaat qilinadigan matn</p>
<p class="answer">C) Grammatik qoida</p>
<p class="answer">D) Fonetik hodisa</p>

<p class="question">96. Tilshunoslikda "yazykovaya igra" (til o'yini) nima?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Bolalar o'yini</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Til normalarini ataylab buzish orqali ijodiy effekt yaratish</p>
<p class="answer">C) Grammatik mashq</p>
<p class="answer">D) Fonetik mashq</p>

<p class="question">97. "Naiv" (sodda) anatomiya tilshunoslikda nimani anglatadi?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Tibbiy terminlar</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Oddiy odamlarning tana a'zolari haqidagi kundalik tasavvurlari tildagi aksi</p>
<p class="answer">C) Grammatik tushuncha</p>
<p class="answer">D) Fonetik tushuncha</p>

<p class="question">98. Til va hokimiyat (vlast') munosabati qaysi yo'nalishda o'rganiladi?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Fonetika</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Kritik diskurs-tahlil</p>
<p class="answer">C) Morfologiya</p>
<p class="answer">D) Dialektologiya</p>

<p class="question">99. Metonimiya kognitiv tilshunoslikda qanday tushuniladi?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Badiiy bezak</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Bir konseptual soha orqali boshqasiga murojaat qilish mexanizmi</p>
<p class="answer">C) Grammatik hodisa</p>
<p class="answer">D) Fonetik hodisa</p>

<p class="question">100. Antroposentrik tilshunoslikning amaliy ahamiyati nimada?</p>
<p class="answer">A) Faqat nazariy bilim beradi</p>
<p class="answer correct">B) Tarjima, ta'lim, siyosat, reklama, sun'iy intellekt sohalarida qo'llaniladi</p>
<p class="answer">C) Faqat grammatika uchun foydali</p>
<p class="answer">D) Faqat adabiyotshunoslik uchun kerak</p>

<div class="section-line"></div>


<h2>II. OG'ZAKI/YOZMA NAZORAT SAVOLLARI (50 ta)</h2>

<h3>Oraliq nazorat savollari (1-25)</h3>

<p>1. Antroposentrik tilshunoslikning predmeti va ob'yektini tushuntiring.</p>
<p>2. Tilshunoslikdagi ilmiy paradigmalar (qiyosiy-tarixiy, struktural, antroposentrik) orasidagi farqlarni izohlang.</p>
<p>3. Antroposentrik paradigmaning shakllanish tarixini va uning asosiy vakillarini sanab bering.</p>
<p>4. V. fon Gumboldtning "tilning ichki shakli" nazariyasini tushuntiring.</p>
<p>5. Sapir-Uorf gipotezasining mohiyati va uning zamonaviy talqinlarini bayon qiling.</p>
<p>6. Kognitiv tilshunoslikning asosiy tushunchalari va tadqiqot usullarini izohlang.</p>
<p>7. Konsept tushunchasini ta'riflang va uning tarkibiy qismlarini keltiring.</p>
<p>8. Kontseptosfera nima? Milliy kontseptosferaning xususiyatlarini tushuntiring.</p>
<p>9. Konseptual metafora nazariyasini (J. Leykoff, M. Jonson) misollar bilan izohlang.</p>
<p>10. Freym nazariyasining mohiyati va tilshunoslikdagi ahamiyatini tushuntiring.</p>
<p>11. Kategoriyalash (kategorizatsiya) va prototip nazariyasini (E. Rosh) misollar bilan tushuntiring.</p>
<p>12. Lingvokulturologiyaning predmeti, maqsadi va vazifalari nimalardan iborat?</p>
<p>13. Lingvokulturema tushunchasini izohlab, misollar keltiring.</p>
<p>14. "Olamning lisoniy manzarasi" (yazykovaya kartina mira) tushunchasini bayon qiling.</p>
<p>15. Olamning ilmiy va sodda (naiv) lisoniy manzarasi orasidagi farqni misollar bilan ko'rsating.</p>
<p>16. Til shaxsiyati (yazykovaya lichnost') nazariyasini (Yu.N. Karaulov) batafsil izohlang.</p>
<p>17. Til shaxsiyatining uch darajasi (verbal-semantik, lingvokognitiv, pragmatik) haqida so'zlang.</p>
<p>18. Psixolingvistikaning antroposentrik tilshunoslikdagi o'rni va ahamiyatini tushuntiring.</p>
<p>19. Nutq aktlari nazariyasining (J. Ostin, J. Syorl) mohiyatini izohlang.</p>
<p>20. Lokutiv, illokutiv va perlokutiv aktlarni misollar bilan tushuntiring.</p>
<p>21. Graysning kooperatsiya prinsipi va uning to'rtta maksimasini misollar bilan bayon qiling.</p>
<p>22. Presuppozitsiya va implikatura tushunchalarini farqlang va misollar keltiring.</p>
<p>23. Sotsiolingvistikaning antroposentrik tilshunoslikdagi o'rni nimada?</p>
<p>24. Til va identifikatsiya (milliy, shaxsiy, ijtimoiy o'zlikni anglash) munosabatini tushuntiring.</p>
<p>25. Antroposentrik tilshunoslikning asosiy prinsiplari (antroposentrizm, ekspansionizm, funksionalizm, eksplikativlik) ni izohlang.</p>


<h3>Yakuniy nazorat savollari (26-50)</h3>

<p>26. Emotiv lingvistikaning predmeti va uning antroposentrik tilshunoslikdagi o'rnini tushuntiring.</p>
<p>27. Emotsiyalarning tilda ifodalanish vositalarini (leksik, grammatik, prosodik, paratil) tasniflang.</p>
<p>28. Genderlingvistikaning asosiy masalalari va tadqiqot yo'nalishlarini bayon qiling.</p>
<p>29. Lingvopragmatikaning predmeti va asosiy kategoriyalarini izohlang.</p>
<p>30. Diskurs va matn tushunchalarining farqi nimada? Diskurs tahlilining asosiy usullarini sanang.</p>
<p>31. Kritik diskurs-tahlil (N. Ferklaf, T. van Deyk) ning maqsadi va usullarini tushuntiring.</p>
<p>32. Til va hokimiyat (vlast') munosabatini misollar bilan izohlang.</p>
<p>33. Kommunikativ muvaffaqiyatsizlik turlari va ularning sabablarini tushuntiring.</p>
<p>34. Muloqot strategiyalari va taktikalarini tasniflang (kooperatsiya, manipulyatsiya, konfrontatsiya).</p>
<p>35. Antropomorfizm va somatik frazeologizmlarning lingvokulturologik tahlilini amalga oshiring.</p>
<p>36. O'zbek tilidagi somatik frazeologizmlarni antroposentrik yondashuv asosida tahlil qiling.</p>
<p>37. Metafora va metonimiyaning kognitiv tilshunoslikdagi talqini qanday? Misollar keltiring.</p>
<p>38. Mental leksikon tushunchasi va uning tuzilishini izohlang.</p>
<p>39. Til o'yini (yazykovaya igra) hodisasini antroposentrik nuqtai nazardan tahlil qiling.</p>
<p>40. Precedent matnlar va ularning lingvokulturologik ahamiyatini tushuntiring.</p>
<p>41. Intertekstuallik tushunchasini va uning antroposentrik tilshunoslikdagi ahamiyatini bayon qiling.</p>
<p>42. Suggestiv lingvistikaning mohiyati va qo'llanilish sohalarini tushuntiring.</p>
<p>43. Til va madaniyat munosabatining o'zbek tilshunosligidagi tadqiqotlarini tahlil qiling.</p>
<p>44. "Vaqt", "Makon", "Sevgi" konseptlarining lingvokulturologik tahlilini qanday amalga oshirish mumkin?</p>
<p>45. Deyksis (ko'rsatish) kategoriyasining antroposentrik tabiatini tushuntiring.</p>
<p>46. Modallikning antroposentrik mohiyati va uning tilda ifodalanish vositalarini ko'rsating.</p>
<p>47. Evidentsiallik kategoriyasini va uning turli tillardagi ko'rinishlarini taqqoslang.</p>
<p>48. Antroposentrik tilshunoslikning amaliy sohalari (tarjima, ta'lim, reklama, sun'iy intellekt) haqida gapiring.</p>
<p>49. O'zbek tilshunosligida antroposentrik yo'nalishning rivojlanishi va istiqbollarini baholang.</p>
<p>50. Antroposentrik tilshunoslikning boshqa fanlar (falsafa, psixologiya, sotsiologiya, madaniyatshunoslik) bilan aloqasini izohlang.</p>

<br><br>
<p><i>Tayyorlagan: Antroposentrik tilshunoslik fani bo'yicha nazorat materiallari</i></p>

